            "title": "<p>Natural Variation</p>",
            "description": "<p>Unlike diamonds, sapphires are not graded through a universal system.</p><p>Instead, each stone is assessed individually based on:</p><ul><li>Colour</li><li>Tone and saturation</li><li>Clarity (often including natural inclusions)</li><li>Cut and overall presence</li></ul><p>Inclusions<br/> and colour variation are not flaws, but rather part of the story of the<br/> stone - a reflection of its natural formation.</p>",
            "description_mobile": "<p>Unlike diamonds, sapphires are not graded through a universal system.</p><p>Instead, each stone is assessed individually based on:</p><ul><li>Colour</li><li>Tone and saturation</li><li>Clarity (often including natural inclusions)</li><li>Cut and overall presence</li></ul><p>Inclusions<br/> and colour variation are not flaws, but rather part of the story of the<br/> stone - a reflection of its natural formation.</p>",
