            "subheading": "",
            "title": "<p>Durability & Everyday Wear</p>",
            "description": "<p>Sapphires are one of the most durable gemstones available, making them well suited to everyday wear.</p><p>However, like all fine jewellery, they should be worn with care:</p><ul><li>Avoid hard knocks or impact</li><li>Remove during heavy activity</li><li>Clean gently and regularly</li></ul><p>With the right care, a sapphire piece can become a modern heirloom, passed down through generations.</p>",
            "description_mobile": "<p>Sapphires are one of the most durable gemstones available, making them well suited to everyday wear.</p><p>However, like all fine jewellery, they should be worn with care:</p><ul><li>Avoid hard knocks or impact</li><li>Remove during heavy activity</li><li>Clean gently and regularly</li></ul><p>With the right care, a sapphire piece can become a modern heirloom, passed down through generations.</p>",
